{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunted Service</strong> is a short, immersive psychological horror experience where the familiar turns terrifying. One night, while home alone, you receive a chilling message from an unknown sender:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Congratulations! You got a haunted service.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you can react, the power goes out. The entire house is swallowed by darkness, leaving only your flashlight to guide you.\u00a0As you explore, strange occurrences escalate\u2014doors creak shut on their own, eerie whispers echo in the silence, and something lurks in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it through the night? <i>Or will you become part of the Haunted Service?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, intense horror experience</strong>\u00a0with 10-20 mins playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror atmosphere</strong> with eerie sounds and unsettling visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tension-building events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple yet chilling story</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Service","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538840/ebd59f489ad1c603f779d5eae1fcc20133bc9827.jpg"},{"name":"Survive the Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538840/29795570abf87b486b2b562ad889bfec715f9e51.jpg"},{"name":"Bookworm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538840/959508227a45dde2fcb03f89545ddb75d13208d5.jpg"},{"name":"Knife Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538840/7afc7ecfeefbd04755bd06f7da2f1560d3cf072f.jpg"},{"name":"Safe Zone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com